flowchart LR
  S[solver] -->|chooses and executes| M[solving macro]
  P[program] -->|may track, analyse, check, protect, reuse| M
  P -->|may propose setups for a named target| U[setup search]
  P -->|may list repairs at a named cap, unranked| R[repair list]
  P -. never chooses, outputs or executes one alone .- X[solving]
  O[the solver's own tool, in their workspace] -->|word accepted at preview in a solving session| M
  K[someone else's package] -. word refused at preview there .- M
